WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.333
Lift from the first trolley.

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:03.250
Carry up and to the right beside the stairs.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.500
Turn at the foot of the sorting counter.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.417
Carry down and to the right along the counter.

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:08.167
Set the parcel on the second trolley.

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.250
Push the loaded trolley, then pull it back.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.917
Collect the parcel and turn for the return journey.

00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:13.833
Carry up and to the left along the counter.

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:15.750
Carry down and to the left beside the stairs.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.250
Return the parcel to the first trolley.

